{"ref":"BDB, אַלּוּף²","hw":"אַלּוּף²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:51\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.51\">1 Ch 1:51</a></sup> <strong>chief, chiliarch (</strong>denom. from ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלָף</span> v. Di <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">Gn 36:15</a><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">Gn 36:15</a> +; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּפֵי (אַלֻּפֵי)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוּפֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:19\" href=\"/Genesis.36.19\">Gn 36:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:30\" href=\"/Genesis.36.30\">30</a>—<em>chief</em> (tribal) of Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">Gn 36:15</a> (5 times) + 38 times <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36\" href=\"/Genesis.36\">Gn 36</a> (P); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:51\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.51\">1 Ch 1:51</a> (4 times) + 9 times; of Judah <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:5\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.5\">Zc 12:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 12:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.12.6\">6</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">אַלֻּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.7\">9:7</a> (in sim.)","next":"BDB, אָלַף³","prev":"BDB, אָלַף²"}